# Go Code Style

## Penamaan

| Jenis | Konvensi |
|-------|----------|
| Package | lowercase, singular feature (`auth`, `product`) |
| File | snake-ish pendek: `handler.go`, `service.go`, `repository.go`, `model.go` |
| Exported | PascalCase |
| JSON tags | camelCase (`json:"refreshToken"`) |
| DB columns | snake_case via GORM default |

## Pola feature (HTTP)

Feature API hidup di `internal/http/<feature>/`:

```go
type Handler struct { svc *Service }
func NewHandler(svc *Service) *Handler
func (h *Handler) RegisterRoutes(rg *gin.RouterGroup, jwtSecret string)

type Service struct { repo Repository; /* deps */ }
func NewService(...) *Service

type Repository interface { /* methods */ }
func NewRepository(db *gorm.DB) Repository
```

Worker feature → `internal/worker/<feature>/` (tanpa Gin handler).

## Error handling

- Sentinel errors di `internal/domain`
- Map di handler dengan `errors.Is`
- Jangan leak internal error message ke client (pakai `"internal error"`)

## Response

```go
response.OK(c, "success", data)
response.Created(c, "product created", data)
response.Fail(c, http.StatusUnauthorized, domain.ErrUnauthorized.Error())
```

## Lainnya

- DI via **Uber fx** di `cmd/api` / `cmd/worker` (bukan manual wire panjang)
- Logging: `log/slog`
- Config: `internal/config` dari env (12-factor); validasi struct tag — API key ≠ `url`
- Jangan import `internal/...` dari package luar module
